Tag: purpose::console
Description: Go programming language compiler - default version
 Puts go and gofmt on PATH, pointing at the Go 1.26 toolchain.
 .
 Named golang-default rather than golang-go because the bootstrap repository
 pins every one of its own packages above this one, so a package sharing its
 name would be downgraded by apt upgrade. It provides golang-go, so the
 bootstrap's golang metapackage stays satisfied.
